  "maxims": [
    { "text": "Lack of time is an excuse. You don't need to study for hours every day; you need to make the most of the time you have.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 1" },
    { "text": "Thirty minutes every day is worth more than two hours every now and then.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 1" },
    { "text": "Train tactics in every single session, even if only for a few minutes.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 5" },
    { "text": "Your opponent also has the right to exist.", "source": "Mark Dvoretsky" },
    { "text": "There is no magic formula. Take your time, but you do have to study.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 1" },
    { "text": "Building a study habit matters far more than setting result goals.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 1" },
    { "text": "Chess is a fight.", "source": "Rafael Leitão · MRL, Module 7" }
  ],
